<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back further 2.8 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back further 2.8 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Thursday it had bought back a further 2.8 million of its own shares off-market on Wednesday, as part of its NZ$1 billion share buyback programme.</p>
<p>It bought the shares at NZ$6.49 each.</p>
<p>The shares were trading at $6.55, up five cents, in early afternoon trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
